Ball Balancer
=============

This project is a reimplementation of the "Ball Balancer" project by
aaedmusa, published on Instructables on 26 April 2023.

    Ball Balancer, by aaedmusa
    https://www.instructables.com/Ball-Balancer/
    Licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0

The mechanism, the electronics selection, the pin assignments, the control
approach and the fastener schedule all come from that write-up. The CAD and
the firmware in this repository were written from scratch against the
published description.

No files from the original project are redistributed here. No STL, no Fusion
archive and no source file from the author's own repository appears in this
repository. docs/source-and-assumptions.md sets out exactly which details
come from the source and which were decided here.

The author's GitHub repository for this project carries no licence file,
which under GitHub's terms reserves all rights. None of that code is used or
reproduced.

Because this work is derived from a CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 source, the CAD and
documentation here carry the same licence. See LICENSE-CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0.md.
The firmware is original work and is offered under the MIT licence in
LICENSE.
